# Products API — REST Client (VS Code / Cursor extension "REST Client")
#
# Requisitos:
#   1. API en marcha → pnpm --filter api run dev
#   2. Seed con empresa demo + categorías/productos → pnpm db:seed:dev
#   3. Login abajo → @accessToken
#
# Tip: tras el seed, ejecuta GET /categories/all para copiar ids reales en @categoryId1 / @categoryId2

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@email = prueba@ejemplo.com
@password = Password123

@productId = reemplaza-con-id-de-producto
@categoryId1 = cmptvvtwi00043c50qdavuoi6
@categoryId2 = cmptvvtwa00033c5042fafv9d

### Login (obtener accessToken)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Verificar contexto JWT + empresa
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Listar productos (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&take=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Listar productos (búsqueda por nombre o código)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?q=coca&page=1&take=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Listar productos filtrados por categoría
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?categoryId={{categoryId1}}&page=1&take=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Listar productos (solo activos operativamente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?isActive=true&page=1&take=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Crear producto (sin categorías)
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Producto de prueba",
  "code": "TEST-001",
  "description": "Creado desde products.http",
  "price": 99.99,
  "isActive": true
}

###

@productId = cmptvvtxi00053c505z9j8bn5

### Crear producto con varias categorías (many-to-many implícito)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Combo snack + bebida",
  "code": "COMBO-001",
  "description": "Producto en múltiples categorías",
  "price": 120.00,
  "categoryIds": ["{{categoryId1}}", "{{categoryId2}}"],
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Crear producto (código duplicado — debe responder 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Otro producto",
  "code": "TEST-001",
  "price": 50.00
}

###

### Obtener producto por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Actualizar producto
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Producto de prueba (editado)",
  "price": 109.99,
  "categoryIds": ["{{categoryId1}}"]
}

###

### Quitar todas las categorías de un producto
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryIds": []
}

###

### Desactivar producto (isActive = false)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Activar producto (isActive = true)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Eliminar producto (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### Crear producto (validación — price negativo, debe fallar 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Inválido",
  "code": "INV-001",
  "price": -10
}

###

### Sin token — debe responder 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

###
